# Markdown is internal by default.
#
# With no .vercelignore, every tracked .md deployed as a static asset and served
# at 200: implementation plans and design specs under docs/superpowers/, a
# Supabase/Vercel/Namecheap deployment runbook, and a funnel checklist. robots.txt
# allows every crawler except /api/, and the files carried no X-Robots-Tag, so all
# of it was publicly crawlable and indexable.
#
# The accomplishments record is the one markdown file meant to be public.
*.md
!docs/accomplishments.md
